<section id="sessions" class="fade-up">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">What actually happens</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">A session, plainly described</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">No performance, no chanting, no incense you didn't ask for. Just a clear structure, held the same way every time.</p>
    <div class="flow-grid">
      <div class="flow-card"><div class="flow-num">I</div><div><h3>A short conversation on WhatsApp</h3><p>Before anything else, we talk briefly on WhatsApp — and agree on the format, the time and the place. Same-day and next-day slots are often possible. No forms, no history-taking.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flow-card"><div class="flow-num">II</div><div><h3>45 minutes, fully clothed</h3><p>You lie down; I work with hands lightly placed or held just above the body, moving along a set sequence. Most people rest deeply or fall asleep — both are normal.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flow-card"><div class="flow-num">III</div><div><h3>A few minutes to return</h3><p>We close quietly. I'll share anything worth noting; you're never asked to interpret or perform an experience you didn't have.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flow-card"><div class="flow-num">IV</div><div><h3>Where it happens</h3><p>At your villa, on your yacht, in your hotel room, or at my private space in Cannes — whichever keeps it unhurried and unseen. Distance sessions are available if you're travelling: we agree a time, you lie down wherever you are, and I work from here.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
